OL,3,ATrump praises father who shot attacker
OL,4,Aduring Oregon school shooting as 'great
OL,5,Ahero'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour people, including a teacher and
OL,8,Fchildren aged five, eight and 11, were
OL,9,Fkilled in a shooting at Silver Rail
OL,10,FElementary School in Bend on Thursday -
OL,11,Fhere's what we know, and don't know, so
OL,12,Ffar
OL,14,FThe suspected attacker has been
OL,15,Fidentified as 16-year-old John Griffin,
OL,16,Fthe BBC's US partner CBS News reports
OL,18,FGriffin was shot dead by a father whose
OL,19,Ftwo daughters attend the school.
OL,21,FUS President Donald Trump praised him
OL,22,Fas a "great hero"
